# Form: release notes

Use for an actual chosen release scope, not a permission to tag/publish or an invented
shipment. Default output: existing release family or `docs/releases/<version>.md`.
Copy payload only; [metadata](../../references/metadata.md) applies to the record.
Essential: user changes, support/upgrade constraints, exact scope and evidence limits.
Remove irrelevant fixes/features/migration sections; no mandatory empty N/A. A local
candidate record is not a public release and must say so. Public license/wording are
owner decisions, not template defaults.

